                                "sense_id": "b5c8c951-0302-3832-afb0-240fb2114413",
                                "text": "And I secure covers to my jointed hoops by rivets or screws, to keep the dirt from the grooved flanched hoops. Or I fix to the naves of the wheels hoops made of iron, brass, or any other proper metal, with three or more necked[…]"
